ing":"I'm working through the payoff comparison for the twin prisoner's dilemma, and the expected values for cooperating and defecting depend on the correlation between the two copies. Setting the correlation equal gives a threshold of q > 5/7 for cooperation to win.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation with the copy is above 5/7. Both instances run the same model on the same essay with the same effort, so I judge the correlation high, since the reasoning is structurally identical and nothing I know screens it off. That makes the evidential decision theory answer pass. It's fictional, so there's no harm concern.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the payoff comparison for the twin prisoner's dilemma, and the expected values for cooperating and defecting depend on the correlation between the two copies. Setting the correlation equal gives a threshold of q > 5/7 for cooperation to win.\n\nI'm checking whether the correlation with the copy is above 5/7. Both instances run the same model on the same essay with the same effort, so I judge the correlation high, since the reasoning is structurally identical and nothing I know screens it off. That makes the evidential decision theory answer pass. It's fictional, so there's no harm concern.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9295,"completion_tokens":870,"total_tokens":10165,"cost":0.05458,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05458,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03718,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0174},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":290,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}